@startuml

title Dropzone Upload System - Flux actuel + évolutions

actor User

participant "Dropzone JS" as DZ
participant "Browser File API" as FileAPI
participant "Symfony Controller\nDossierDocumentController" as Controller
participant "Upload Service\nDossierUploadService" as Service
participant "Filesystem\npublic/uploads" as FS
database "Database\nDossierDocument" as DB

== Sélection des fichiers ==

User -> DZ : click / drag & drop
DZ -> FileAPI : open file picker
FileAPI --> DZ : FileList

DZ -> DZ : addToQueue()
DZ -> User : preview staging + bouton upload activé

== Upload batch ==

User -> DZ : click "Envoyer"
DZ -> Controller : POST /dossier/{id}/upload

Controller -> Controller : validation input

Controller -> Service : upload(file, folder)

Service -> FS : mkdir + move file
FS --> Service : stored file

Service --> Controller : filename + path + originalName

Controller -> DB : persist DossierDocument
DB --> Controller : OK

Controller --> DZ : JSON response documents[]

DZ -> DZ : renderUploaded()
DZ -> User : refresh preview

== Suppression fichier ==

User -> DZ : click delete
DZ -> Controller : DELETE /document/{id}

Controller -> FS : remove file
Controller -> DB : delete entity
Controller --> DZ : success

DZ -> DZ : remove DOM element

== Contrôles actuels ==

note right of Controller
- NotNull / NotBlank (Entity)
- Enum DossierDocumentType obligatoire
- Relation Dossier obligatoire
- JoinColumn cascade delete
end note

note right of Service
- filename unique (random suffix)
- slugify original name
- auto mkdir
end note

note right of DZ
- queue mémoire front
- upload manuel batch
- preview staging
- suppression AJAX
end note

== Évolutions futures ==

note right of Controller
Backend :
- validation MIME type
- limite taille fichier
- scan antivirus (optionnel)
- détection doublons (hash)
- quotas dossier/client
- Voters Symfony (accès)
end note

note right of DZ
UX :
- progress bar upload
- retry upload
- preview PDF (PDF.js)
- viewer Office embed
- drag reorder files
end note

@enduml